  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under Section 522 of the Bankruptcy Code, debtors may exempt certain property. Carson''s $40,000 home equity exceeds the $30,000 homestead exemption by $10,000, so the trustee can reach that excess. The vehicle ($5,000) is fully covered by the $6,000 exemption. The stamp collection has no applicable exemption and is fully reachable.
Wrong (B): Only the exempt portion of home equity is protected. The $10,000 exceeding the homestead exemption is available to the trustee for liquidation.
