  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under SOX Section 301, every audit committee member must be an independent director who may not accept any consulting, advisory, or compensatory fee beyond board compensation. Adams is disqualified by the $75,000 consulting fee, and Bell''s former audit firm partnership within the cooling-off period compromises independence under SEC rules.
Wrong (A): Adams''s consulting fee violates the independence requirement. Relevant expertise does not override the prohibition on compensatory relationships.
